From 2f59b0c18952ae3712ba7a00d5bcb041a3fef68d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TAKANO Mitsuhiro <takano32@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:17:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] arm64: errata: Fix QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_E1041 name in
 silicon-errata

The Falkor E1041 entry in the arm64 silicon-errata table names
QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_1041, but the symbol defined in arch/arm64/Kconfig
and used in arch/arm64/include/asm/assembler.h is
QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_E1041.  Correct the name in the table.

The missing "E" reads as deliberate, because the neighbouring E1003 and
E1009 entries do name QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_1003 and _1009, without the
prefix.  Only the E1041 symbol carries it.

The Kconfig symbol itself is left unchanged: the table has carried the
wrong name since 2017, and the fix belongs there.  Before this change,
QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_1041 appeared only in this entry.

Only the text of the table changes, and no build was run.

Fixes: 932b50c7c1c6 ("arm64: Add software workaround for Falkor erratum 1041")
---
 Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst b/Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst
index afea5e57ab95..f554fa04662c 100644
--- a/Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst
+++ b/Documentation/arch/arm64/silicon-errata.rst
@@ -360,7 +360,7 @@ stable kernels.
 +----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------------------+
 | Qualcomm Tech. | QDF2400 ITS     | E0065           | QCOM_QDF2400_ERRATUM_0065   |
 +----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------------------+
-| Qualcomm Tech. | Falkor v{1,2}   | E1041           | QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_1041    |
+| Qualcomm Tech. | Falkor v{1,2}   | E1041           | QCOM_FALKOR_ERRATUM_E1041   |
 +----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------------------+
 | Qualcomm Tech. | Kryo4xx Gold    | N/A             | ARM64_ERRATUM_1463225       |
 +----------------+-----------------+-----------------+-----------------------------+
